          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">You must include a Chaos Warmaster in your fleet no matter its size. They must be assigned to the biggest (most expensive) ship in the fleet. Its leadership improves to the match theirs. The warmaster may take up to 4 marks of chaos with no duplicates.</characteristic>
