          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">Up to two capital ships (including the flagship) can have daemonic entities and warp beats swirl about its hull, including daemonships. Once per battle, a single enemy ship within 15cm takes D6 hits in the end phase (shields have no effect).</characteristic>
